%% TECH-023 Browser tests back inside the time budget
%% How the time of a test is spent, and where it was cut.
flowchart TD
    A[Test starts] --> B[Open page]
    B --> C{Element appears after a delay?}
    C -- "Playwright polls 20 / 100 / 500 ms" --> D[Found up to 500 ms late]
    C -- "appears(): polls every 25 ms (TECH-023-R2)" --> E[Found at once]
    D --> F[Click a flight card]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Card animating?}
    G -- "no-preference: wait for it" --> H[About 0,4 s]
    G -- "reduced motion (default): no animation (TECH-023-R2)" --> I[Click at once]
